## 4. Key Vocabulary

| Word / Phrase | Meaning | Example Sentence |
|---|---|---|
| evolution | 演進、逐步發展 | AI technology has undergone rapid **evolution** in recent years. |
| rapid | 快速的、迅速的 | There has been a **rapid** increase in demand for electric cars. |
| advancement | 進步、前進 | We have seen great **advancement** in medical research this decade. |

## 5. Useful Sentence Pattern

**Pattern:** `Subject + experience/undergo + rapid evolution`

**Example:** The software industry experiences rapid evolution every few years.

## 6. Speaking Version
"changing really fast" / "moving at lightning speed"

## 7. Common Mistake

❌ **Wrong:** quickly evolvement
✅ **Correct:** rapid evolution

"Evolution" 是名詞，要搭配形容詞 "rapid"，不能用副詞 "quickly"；而 "evolvement" 並不常用，標準用詞是 "evolution"。

## 8. One Sentence to Remember
In a world of rapid evolution, those who adapt fastest win.

